[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS004
TITLE: Render readbacks as the operative clearance, then the call sign
STATEMENT: >>>
A readback shall be rendered as the operative clearance and then the full call sign. Wind and altimeter present on the inbound clearance shall be omitted. The pilot wording for a go-around instruction shall be Going around. Acceptance is a takeoff clearance that includes wind and altimeter and reads back as Cleared for takeoff runway two seven followed by the call sign, with neither wind nor altimeter in the readback.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The readback repeats the clearance elements the AIM treats as the check.
<<<
DAL: E
